# ============================================================================
#  s7_tester.ancl  -  ANCL Native Siemens S7comm Client Tester GUI
#
#  A native Win32 dark-themed Siemens S7comm client, written in ANCL.
#  NexusEdge themed with GlowButtons, live polling ListView grid, read/write.
#  100% CRT-free PE32+, GUI subsystem.
# ============================================================================

